  "<h3>Compositor Windows %1</h3><p>An independent Windows port of Compositor by Robbie Tilton.</p><p>Compose images with layers, masks, selections, painting, adjustments, filters, and background removal. Import and develop RAW images, combine photos with focus stacking, and save editable .comp projects.</p><p>Maintained by <a href=\"https://x.com/Cengokill\">@Cengokill</a>, Compositor Windows receives regular updates that follow Compositor's update history, with approximately one release per week. Full Mac equivalence and project exchange are unverified.</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/robbietilton/Compositor\">Original Compositor project</a><br>Copyright Wonder Assembly LLC. MIT source.</p><p>This independent port is not endorsed by the upstream author.</p><p>Qt and other dependency notices accompany this package.</p>": "<h3>Compositor Windows %1</h3><p>基于 Robbie Tilton 的 Compositor 开发的独立 Windows 移植版。</p><p>使用图层、蒙版、选区、画笔、调整和滤镜合成图像，并保存可编辑的 .comp 工程。支持移除背景、RAW 显影和焦点堆栈。</p><p>Windows 移植版由 <a href=\"https://x.com/Cengokill\">@Cengokill</a> 维护。与 Mac 版的完整功能对等和工程交换仍待验证。</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/robbietilton/Compositor\">原版 Compositor 工程</a><br>版权所有 Wonder Assembly LLC。源码采用 MIT 许可证。</p><p>本独立移植版未获上游作者背书。发行包附有 Qt 和其他依赖的声明。</p>",
